<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi courts sentenced seven French citizens, including six to life, for Islamic State membership, while security forces downed an unidentified drone over Baghdad. Baghdad and the Kurdistan Region deepened security coordination and weapons control, and Iraq announced it will host a 2028 OIC anti-corruption meeting. Prime Minister Al-Zaidi’s visit to Damascus advanced border security talks and oil links, and Turkey welcomed new Iraqi security steps in Sinjar. A sudden ouster of the Iraqi spy chief raised questions about the prime minister’s agenda, and Iraq’s development road plan promises 100,000 jobs. The conflict produced 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxPRm51dlJtSHd5NVdOQ2RXbHU5aGltTktXY2xqU1pRdUFrQTBIcnRKOWlieUNYaWxoVDh3aUtjcmdOQm1iY01oSnR1Uy1DR1hZT29kdTdhbTI1RnY4QWw1SGVHU3IwdDBidzB1Y0V3UHc4TFVDcjRXY1p3b0tXc3I0dnBCcUw0RElMRFBFZFRHRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNYUFiSXVnZGVfSmNZdGZvN3NOdWFURUF0OEw1eXJocnRibkRXRjhoT2VMUFhpeDJDdDVzdDdNWmxfOTE4bm1fTEs0UnkxRVRacThWNTRMNVVVdzhmZG5Bb1o1ODJ5QUxsR01hc0tZQmxqLXNQNzk0QUNLcE1ST3hYc0lNSGxYQlpsRHJUWjdHcVNyWUZuamdVdUN3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxPdHZjTDdkODVraEVJSEJxRkFrVGo4NE5LQzJONkZTdmI4cWNPZHdGRnlwWVlMaGVDVWZkT094Q0RtQlpJU3UyWlJoYUFvV19UZV9JNjVtQjA4WWNlUlhuR29lS2o3R09mSVlMMUk0NFNHMHBpWUg1dHRCRkFTZmFVNXI2VEpEeXVza255ZW1yNlNlU0VxX0lCNjdDVDQ4ekRXWUp3TlVKWGZidWt0SHdUYjlTZ1ZtU0VaSXhzd09TamY1TzJPem5wb3RPQTU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kurdistan24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOeEVzc093V0drQ0tXRk5nTDR2a1JiW